    "goal": "Co-incubate CYP3A4 with UDPGA (substrate) and a competitive inhibitor to quantify the inhibitor:substrate molar ratio, run-condition IC50, and percent inhibition.",
    "rationale": "Competitive inhibition of CYP3A4-mediated UDPGA conjugation. Substrate [S]=834.8 µM at Km=944.4 µM; competitive inhibitor Ki=25.4 µM at [I]=48.7 µM; Vmax=3.2221 µmol/min. The run-condition IC50 follows Cheng-Prusoff (IC50=Ki(1+[S]/Km)); fractional activity follows v_i/v_0=[S]/(Km(1+[I]/Ki)+[S]); percent inhibition = (1-fractional)x100. Assumes pure competitive inhibition and UDPGA as the varied substrate.",
